# L §4.3: "A period is not a law date. at m with m a month is refused (LOAD-LAWPERIOD)."
=== m.tally
model t
  tally 2
  on 2026-12-31
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source s "s"

input rate[m in months]: int

def y[m in months]: int at m
  rule base = rate[m]
=== expect
refused: LOAD-LAWPERIOD ...
